'''BIG''' is a [[:Category:Germany|German]] Esport organization founded in January 2017. The organization also hosts squads in ''[[Valorant:BIG|Valorant]]'', ''[[leagueoflegends:BIG|League Of Legends]]'', ''[[Starcraft2:BIG|Starcraft II]]'', ''[[Counterstrike:BIG|Counter-Strike]]'', ''[[brawlstars:BIG|Brawl Stars]]'' and ''[[arenafps:BIG|Quake]]''.

The Trackmania part of '''BIG''' was created the 2018-03-27 ''(March 27th 2018)'' by the team signing ''Dennis [[Massa]] Lotze'', a professional [[:Category:Germany|German]] player.
==Trivia==
===Awards===
* Awarded ''Team of the Year 2024'' by Trackmania Awards <ref>{{cite web|url=https://tm-awards.com/#Team%20of%20the%20Year|title=Team of the Year|author=Trackmania Awards|publisher=}}</ref>
* Awarded ''Team of the Year 2025'' by Trackmania Awards <ref>{{cite web|url=https://tm-awards.com/#Team%20of%20the%20Year|title=Team of the Year|author=Trackmania Awards|publisher=}}</ref>

